{
 "batchId": "b-0350",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "nl",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_8e32edab60cd7e627ae7",
   "sourceHash": "8e32edab60cd7e627ae76878808978dfc12d1cffd0b84965c491b3c223225746",
   "text": "vóór uw gesprek, zodat het consult volledig op u is afgestemd.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fe0b96a130ef39281377",
   "sourceHash": "fe0b96a130ef39281377916dc7b239e15f5d0e00f78fc9199e5cc21c668bc7d1",
   "text": "Uw online consult",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bfebc25fb72a9e7692e9",
   "sourceHash": "bfebc25fb72a9e7692e9a5829cab29d711f4de7a3a0ac4678388344943044d3c",
   "text": "op het afgesproken tijdstip, via WhatsApp-videogesprek of -telefoongesprek.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4c20512e174796e1af0d",
   "sourceHash": "4c20512e174796e1af0d1ea431cd14ca6a62f88a6b036a8e78dc0d9c95b58c56",
   "text": "Bekijk de gezondheidssamenvatting",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2774c86308825fa019ea",
   "sourceHash": "2774c86308825fa019ea9a765f29eef41d2fdda2a06f6ec70b944b87b6404c88",
   "text": "Open het WhatsApp-concept",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f419605f4ea33d9288b5",
   "sourceHash": "f419605f4ea33d9288b5ebac9c871b0e4fb445063fb8d875b6bfa56188cea09c",
   "text": "Uw browser heeft WhatsApp niet geopend. Gebruik de link om het concept zelf te openen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3526e886e9f4eaf0432a",
   "sourceHash": "3526e886e9f4eaf0432a639b0e4cd20495f2df3c17cc90119625416775463472",
   "text": "Een zorgvuldig proces — geen wachtrij",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6bcf6a00a02ba940a021",
   "sourceHash": "6bcf6a00a02ba940a02199296a49e39c6b012fe3e7e0091b476b79069127b683",
   "text": "Drie rustige stappen, afgestemd op uw tijd en die van uw arts.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1b092312481895ea47b5",
   "sourceHash": "1b092312481895ea47b593dd3743951b2b893edd32a3655c7c7cf6853b73fcb7",
   "text": "Om te beginnen vragen wij heel weinig. De uitgebreide medische voorgeschiedenis volgt daarna via een kort, vertrouwelijk formulier dat u in uw eigen tempo invult — zodat uw arts uw situatie al begrijpt wanneer het consult begint.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_96212ca35f010ab78e82",
   "sourceHash": "96212ca35f010ab78e82ed0e98822d82e1c5b799b644096783845da7843be8a0",
   "text": "U vraagt een consult aan",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_7e4d1431b80e073291b5",
   "sourceHash": "7e4d1431b80e073291b511ad87a458a9924e964e77826bc34e2568b7ecb9c362",
   "text": "Een minuut of twee van uw tijd — uw klacht en hoe wij u kunnen bereiken. Meer hebben wij niet nodig om te beginnen.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5ef5cee68c1de40a11b3",
   "sourceHash": "5ef5cee68c1de40a11b3abf90f57e628c9d493e8a73e6017c5f681248522d069",
   "text": "1–2 minuten",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4bf1052380efb4485a00",
   "sourceHash": "4bf1052380efb4485a00c073c672b25db937e7507c78499ded278278511fdc81",
   "text": "U vult een gezondheidssamenvatting in",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_bd47a0c5c256c8e0a589",
   "sourceHash": "bd47a0c5c256c8e0a5899e63dc54bfe093dd4794b42c5de5f29993e1933f5e03",
   "text": "Een kort, vertrouwelijk formulier dat wij u via WhatsApp of e-mail sturen. Vitale functies, voorgeschiedenis en een Ayurvedische functionele beoordeling — grotendeels aantikken, in uw eigen tempo. Het meesturen van uitslagen is optioneel.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f6542308275293a7a8f0",
   "sourceHash": "f6542308275293a7a8f037d56e3a744b992e92f8e7e0a9fe80a91ca864fc9c2e",
   "text": "Wanneer het u uitkomt · vóór het gesprek",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_84347c7209880dab2127",
   "sourceHash": "84347c7209880dab21272bfa6755d00bbd5ec973e8840d8f26d29f1f62dcc11f",
   "text": "U spreekt uw arts online",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9ccd79caaa978648bb64",
   "sourceHash": "9ccd79caaa978648bb64dd04a0b4cf17a7827740c2385f27742c1afca1fa9e59",
   "text": "Omdat de arts uw samenvatting vooraf heeft gelezen, geeft hij of zij een weloverwogen beoordeling en een eerlijk oordeel over geschikte behandelprogramma’s.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cdc4989e397ac2909b23",
   "sourceHash": "cdc4989e397ac2909b23446b54c3d0981aa9e8ece6b3ff2324d60d187f4f0e22",
   "text": "Via WhatsApp-videogesprek of -telefoongesprek",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ba2b5d4ace06046f6305",
   "sourceHash": "ba2b5d4ace06046f63055ff2c1f8579267f4bafe083275dd7006e867cef64da4",
   "text": "Bekijk de gezondheidssamenvatting die u gaat invullen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a5b868b6274347b2bcfb",
   "sourceHash": "a5b868b6274347b2bcfb1a2d8056449e77ed15ff0d8b9c9546bb2618af147784",
   "text": "Waarom patiënten dit consult vertrouwen",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a22aa8ea5e340c312713",
   "sourceHash": "a22aa8ea5e340c312713415a579602e6c74956c149ea4f426fe50f946393a03a",
   "text": "De normen van een opleidingsziekenhuis, een eeuw zorg van één familie.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e79daccdddd394d8f148",
   "sourceHash": "e79daccdddd394d8f148d2b3fbfa60091087f5809e3ccdabbb4e1969a12e893f",
   "text": "Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village is een NABH-geaccrediteerd Ayurvedisch ziekenhuis in Kodumbu, Palakkad, Kerala — een medische instelling, geen vrijetijdsaccommodatie. Uw consult vindt plaats bij gekwalificeerde artsen, ondersteund door onze eigen WHO-GMP-gecertificeerde apotheek en 118 jaar familiepraktijk.",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_16153697cce91b70e1e5",
   "sourceHash": "16153697cce91b70e1e5106dabbc8f28e645709e57a8b10f059a81ea0a126ca3",
   "text": "Geaccrediteerd Ayurvedisch ziekenhuis",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_40e3788516663a344ec3",
   "sourceHash": "40e3788516663a344ec39cd6595dad5879a1865061f72dd8fdab32d912db53a4",
   "text": "Familiepraktijk Ramesh · 118 jaar",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_98ded612638c598865a4",
   "sourceHash": "98ded612638c598865a4d29d1acf386ce05cf4cdd09fe3bfbcf61a72f1f510ba",
   "text": "Klinische praktijk van onze hoofdarts, Dr. Deepu John",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
